      "id": 77259,
      "name": "Theta_Sigma",
      "username": "Theta_Sigma",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-15T17:05:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Omnitron's end of turn ability happens first, because he was in play first. Then each other effect happens in order they came out. If the highest HP hero gets hit by the first drone and is no longer has the highest HP, the second would attack the new hero with the highest HP.</p>",
