      "id": 77261,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-15T17:28:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Simultaneous effects (like multiple end of turn effects) are always handled by order of play. It's in the rulebook. Omnitrons character card was in play first so he would go first.&nbsp;</p><p>Consecutive effects happen with newest resolving first. I think that's what skippy was getting at. I just kinda parroted it with less words.&nbsp;</p>",
