      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-15T18:06:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah I just noticed that card effects \"occured in the order in which the cards entered play\" in the rule book shortly after I posted. Thanks though.</p><p>Another question...Omnitron has several cards that say \"Destroy this card when Omnitron is dealt 7 or more damage in one round\". If Omnitron has multiple of those type of cards in play and is dealt the needed amount of damage, are those cards destroyed one-by-one in the order they came into play or are all of them destroyed at once? Would I have to deal Omnitron ANOTHER 7 damage to destroy the other one(s)?</p><p>Right now my guess is that once 7 damage is dealt to Omnitron, then those cards are all destroyed...but I just want to make sure.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:58:13.018Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
